8. Three levels of success

Level Scientific question Required evidence
Level 1: Mechanism Does the mechanism work under controlled conditions? Controlled simulation, matched budgets, operationalized negative controls
Level 2: Generalization Does it work in unseen environments? Held-out environments, dynamics shifts, observation shifts
Level 3: Operational utility Does it improve real decisions and reduce harm? Decision-level outcomes, operational harm rate, safety-shield behavior

A Level 1 improvement in an internal metric is not evidence of Level 3 utility. The protocol reports the level at which each claim is supported.

